[
  {"id": "through-the-roof", "style": "parchment", "genre": "miracle", "title": "Through the Roof", "ref": "Mark 2:11",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "A paralysed man had four friends who refused to give up. The house was packed. So they climbed onto the roof.", "sky": "day", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "house", "x": 600, "s": 1.1}, {"k": "crowd", "x": 600, "y": 1385, "s": 0.8, "n": 9},
              {"k": "man", "x": 420, "y": 1140, "s": 1.2}, {"k": "man", "x": 760, "y": 1140, "s": 1.2, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "reach", "at": 1.6}]}]},
    {"say": "They broke it open, and let down the bed wherein the sick of the palsy lay.", "sky": "day", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "mat", "x": 540, "y": 1050, "s": 1.3, "acts": [{"do": "climb", "to": 1380, "at": 0.6, "dur": 3.2}]},
              {"k": "man", "in": 0, "x": -10, "y": -16, "s": 1.05, "acts": [{"do": "lie"}]}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 830, "s": 1.6, "flip": true}]},
    {"say": "Jesus saw their faith, and said: Son, thy sins be forgiven thee.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "mat", "x": 470, "s": 1.3}, {"k": "man", "in": 0, "x": -10, "y": -16, "s": 1.05, "acts": [{"do": "lie"}]},
              {"k": "jesus", "x": 760, "s": 1.6, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "bless", "at": 0.8}]}]},
    {"say": "Then: Arise, and take up thy bed. He got up and walked out before them all. Your faith can carry someone else to him.", "sky": "dawn", "ground": "city", "fx": ["rays"],
     "cast": [{"k": "man", "x": 420, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "lie"}, {"do": "stand", "at": 1.0}, {"do": "raise", "at": 2.2}]},
              {"k": "jesus", "x": 760, "s": 1.6, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "reach", "at": 0.4}]}]}]},
  {"id": "the-hem-of-his-garment", "style": "parchment", "genre": "miracle", "title": "The Hem of His Garment", "ref": "Mark 5:34",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "Twelve years of bleeding. Every doctor tried, every coin was spent, and she was only getting worse.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "woman", "x": 540, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "kneel", "at": 1.2}]}]},
    {"say": "She thought: If I may touch but his clothes, I shall be whole.", "sky": "day", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "crowd", "x": 620, "y": 1380, "s": 0.95, "n": 10}, {"k": "woman", "x": 120, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "walk", "to": 380, "at": 0.3, "dur": 3}]},
              {"k": "jesus", "x": 640, "s": 1.6, "flip": true}]},
    {"say": "She reached through the crowd and touched him. Jesus stopped: Who touched my clothes?", "sky": "day", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "crowd", "x": 700, "y": 1380, "s": 0.95, "n": 8}, {"k": "woman", "x": 400, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "kneel", "at": 0.3}, {"do": "reach", "at": 0.6}]},
              {"k": "jesus", "x": 560, "s": 1.6, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "lower", "at": 2.2}]}]},
    {"say": "Daughter, thy faith hath made thee whole; go in peace. He did not just heal her. He made sure she was seen.", "sky": "dawn", "ground": "city", "fx": ["rays"],
     "cast": [{"k": "woman", "x": 420, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "kneel"}, {"do": "stand", "at": 2.0}]}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 620, "s": 1.6, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "bless", "at": 0.5}]}]}]},
  {"id": "jairus-daughter", "style": "parchment", "genre": "miracle", "title": "Talitha Cumi", "ref": "Mark 5:41",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "A synagogue ruler fell at Jesus' feet. His twelve-year-old daughter was dying.", "sky": "day", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "man", "x": 420, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "kneel", "at": 0.6}, {"do": "reach", "at": 1.0}]}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 680, "s": 1.6, "flip": true}]},
    {"say": "Then the news came: Thy daughter is dead. Jesus said to him: Be not afraid, only believe.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "man", "x": 400, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "kneel"}]}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 620, "s": 1.6, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "reach", "at": 2.4}]}]},
    {"say": "He took her by the hand, and said: Talitha cumi, which is, Damsel, I say unto thee, arise.", "sky": "night", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "mat", "x": 470, "s": 1.2}, {"k": "child", "in": 0, "x": -20, "y": -16, "s": 1.3, "acts": [{"do": "lie"}]},
              {"k": "jesus", "x": 700, "s": 1.6, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "reach", "at": 0.5}]}]},
    {"say": "And straightway the damsel arose, and walked. When everyone says it is over, listen to him instead.", "sky": "dawn", "ground": "city", "fx": ["rays"],
     "cast": [{"k": "child", "x": 450, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "lie"}, {"do": "stand", "at": 0.6}, {"do": "walk", "to": 330, "at": 1.8, "dur": 2}]},
              {"k": "man", "x": 200, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "raise", "at": 1.6}]}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 720, "s": 1.6, "flip": true}]}]},
  {"id": "widow-of-nain", "style": "parchment", "genre": "miracle", "title": "The Widow of Nain", "ref": "Luke 7:14",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "A funeral leaving the town of Nain. The only son of a widow. She had lost her husband, and now her child.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "hills",
     "cast": [{"k": "crowd", "x": 700, "y": 1360, "s": 0.8, "n": 8}, {"k": "widow", "x": 380, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "walk", "to": 300, "dur": 3}]},
              {"k": "mat", "x": 520, "y": 1330, "s": 1.1}]},
    {"say": "When the Lord saw her, he had compassion on her, and said unto her: Weep not.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "hills",
     "cast": [{"k": "widow", "x": 360, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "kneel", "at": 0.4}]}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 680, "s": 1.6, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "reach", "at": 1.8}]}]},
    {"say": "He touched the bier, and said: Young man, I say unto thee, Arise.", "sky": "day", "ground": "hills",
     "cast": [{"k": "mat", "x": 520, "y": 1330, "s": 1.1}, {"k": "man", "in": 0, "x": -20, "y": -16, "s": 1.1, "acts": [{"do": "lie"}]},
              {"k": "jesus", "x": 760, "s": 1.6, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "raise", "at": 0.6}]}]},
    {"say": "And he that was dead sat up, and began to speak. And he delivered him to his mother. He sees the one who is grieving.", "sky": "dawn", "ground": "hills", "fx": ["rays"],
     "cast": [{"k": "man", "x": 600, "s": 1.5, "acts": [{"do": "lie"}, {"do": "stand", "at": 0.8}, {"do": "walk", "to": 450, "at": 2.6, "dur": 2}]},
              {"k": "widow", "x": 300, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "raise", "at": 2.8}]}]}]},
  {"id": "woman-at-the-well", "style": "parchment", "genre": "encounter", "title": "The Woman at the Well", "ref": "John 4:14",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "Noon, the hottest hour. A Samaritan woman came to the well alone, at the time no one else would see her.", "sky": "day", "ground": "desert",
     "cast": [{"k": "well", "x": 560, "s": 1.2}, {"k": "woman", "x": 1000, "s": 1.55, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "walk", "to": 760, "at": 0.3, "dur": 3.4}]}]},
    {"say": "Jesus, a Jewish man, broke every rule and spoke to her: Give me to drink.", "sky": "day", "ground": "desert",
     "cast": [{"k": "well", "x": 560, "s": 1.2}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 300, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "reach", "at": 1.8}]}, {"k": "woman", "x": 790, "s": 1.55, "flip": true}]},
    {"say": "Whosoever drinketh of the water that I shall give him shall never thirst.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "desert", "fx": ["sparkle"],
     "cast": [{"k": "well", "x": 560, "s": 1.2}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 300, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "bless", "at": 0.4}]}, {"k": "woman", "x": 790, "s": 1.55, "flip": true}]},
    {"say": "He knew everything she had ever done, and still offered her living water. She ran back to tell the whole town.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "desert",
     "cast": [{"k": "well", "x": 380, "s": 1.2}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 180, "s": 1.6}, {"k": "woman", "x": 600, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "run", "to": 1100, "at": 1.4, "dur": 3}]}]}]},
  {"id": "nicodemus-by-night", "style": "parchment", "genre": "encounter", "title": "Nicodemus by Night", "ref": "John 3:16",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "A respected religious leader came to Jesus secretly, by night, with questions he could not ask by day.", "sky": "night", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "elder", "x": 1000, "s": 1.6, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "walk", "to": 700, "at": 0.3, "dur": 4}]}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 320, "s": 1.6}, {"k": "lamp", "x": 500, "y": 1300, "s": 1.2, "acts": [{"do": "flicker"}]}]},
    {"say": "Jesus told him: Except a man be born again, he cannot see the kingdom of God.", "sky": "night", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "elder", "x": 700, "s": 1.6, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "reach", "at": 2.4}]}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 320, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "bless", "at": 0.6}]},
              {"k": "lamp", "x": 500, "y": 1300, "s": 1.2, "acts": [{"do": "flicker"}]}]},
    {"say": "For God so loved the world, that he gave his only begotten Son, that whosoever believeth in him should not perish, but have everlasting life.", "sky": "night", "ground": "city", "fx": ["rays"],
     "cast": [{"k": "jesus", "x": 540, "s": 1.65, "acts": [{"do": "raise", "at": 1.4}]}]},
    {"say": "You do not need daylight or certainty to come to him. Come with your questions, even at night.", "sky": "dawn", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "elder", "x": 600, "s": 1.6, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "kneel", "at": 1.0}]}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 360, "s": 1.6}]}]},
  {"id": "cleansing-the-temple", "style": "parchment", "genre": "event", "title": "Cleansing the Temple", "ref": "John 2:16",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "The temple courts had become a marketplace. Money changers, cattle, and prices that cheated the poor.", "sky": "day", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "table", "x": 330, "s": 1.2}, {"k": "table", "x": 780, "s": 1.2}, {"k": "coin", "x": 300, "y": 1295, "s": 1.6}, {"k": "coin", "x": 760, "y": 1290, "s": 1.6},
              {"k": "man", "x": 180, "s": 1.5}, {"k": "man", "x": 930, "s": 1.5, "flip": true}]},
    {"say": "Jesus made a scourge of small cords, and drove them all out of the temple, and overthrew the tables.", "sky": "day", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "table", "x": 330, "s": 1.2, "acts": [{"do": "collapse", "at": 1.6}]}, {"k": "table", "x": 780, "s": 1.2, "acts": [{"do": "collapse", "at": 2.6}]},
              {"k": "jesus", "x": 540, "s": 1.65, "acts": [{"do": "raise", "at": 1.0}]}, {"k": "man", "x": 820, "s": 1.5, "acts": [{"do": "run", "to": 1200, "at": 1.4, "dur": 2}]}]},
    {"say": "Make not my Father's house an house of merchandise.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "jesus", "x": 540, "s": 1.65, "acts": [{"do": "bless", "at": 0.4}]}]},
    {"say": "His anger was for the people being shut out. Ask what in your life is crowding out the place where you meet God.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "city", "fx": ["rays"],
     "cast": [{"k": "jesus", "x": 540, "s": 1.65}, {"k": "crowd", "x": 540, "y": 1370, "s": 0.6, "n": 10}]}]},
  {"id": "light-of-the-world", "style": "parchment", "genre": "teaching", "title": "The Light of the World", "ref": "Matthew 5:14",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "On a mountainside, Jesus looked at ordinary fishermen, farmers and mothers, and told them who they were.", "sky": "dawn", "ground": "hills",
     "cast": [{"k": "jesus", "x": 540, "y": 1300, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "raise", "at": 2.2}]}, {"k": "crowd", "x": 540, "y": 1400, "s": 0.85, "n": 12}]},
    {"say": "Ye are the light of the world. A city that is set on an hill cannot be hid.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "lamp", "x": 200, "y": 1450, "s": 1.1, "acts": [{"do": "appear", "at": 0.4}, {"do": "flicker"}]}, {"k": "lamp", "x": 420, "y": 1470, "s": 1.1, "acts": [{"do": "appear", "at": 1.2}, {"do": "flicker"}]},
              {"k": "lamp", "x": 660, "y": 1470, "s": 1.1, "acts": [{"do": "appear", "at": 2.0}, {"do": "flicker"}]}, {"k": "lamp", "x": 880, "y": 1450, "s": 1.1, "acts": [{"do": "appear", "at": 2.8}, {"do": "flicker"}]}]},
    {"say": "Neither do men light a candle, and put it under a bushel, but on a candlestick; and it giveth light unto all that are in the house.", "sky": "night", "ground": "city", "fx": ["sparkle"],
     "cast": [{"k": "house", "x": 540, "s": 1.2}, {"k": "lamp", "x": 540, "y": 1180, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "appear", "at": 1.6}, {"do": "flicker"}]}]},
    {"say": "Let your light so shine before men, that they may see your good works, and glorify your Father which is in heaven.", "sky": "dawn", "ground": "hills", "fx": ["rays"],
     "cast": [{"k": "man", "x": 360, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "raise", "at": 1.0}]}, {"k": "woman", "x": 700, "s": 1.55, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "raise", "at": 1.4}]}]}]},
  {"id": "parable-of-the-talents", "style": "parchment", "genre": "parable", "title": "The Parable of the Talents", "ref": "Matthew 25:21",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "A master going on a long journey entrusted his money to three servants: five talents, two, and one.", "sky": "day", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "elder", "x": 200, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "reach", "at": 1.0}]}, {"k": "man", "x": 480, "s": 1.5}, {"k": "man", "x": 680, "s": 1.5}, {"k": "man", "x": 880, "s": 1.5},
              {"k": "chest", "x": 340, "s": 0.8}]},
    {"say": "Two of them traded and doubled what they had. The third was afraid, and hid his talent in the earth.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "field",
     "cast": [{"k": "man", "x": 600, "s": 1.5, "acts": [{"do": "kneel", "at": 1.6}]}, {"k": "chest", "x": 760, "y": 1400, "s": 0.7, "acts": [{"do": "sink", "at": 2.4, "by": 80}]}]},
    {"say": "To the faithful ones the master said: Well done, thou good and faithful servant: enter thou into the joy of thy lord.", "sky": "day", "ground": "city", "fx": ["sparkle"],
     "cast": [{"k": "elder", "x": 300, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "bless", "at": 0.6}]}, {"k": "man", "x": 600, "s": 1.5, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "raise", "at": 2.0}]}, {"k": "man", "x": 780, "s": 1.5, "flip": true}]},
    {"say": "Fear buried the gift; faithfulness multiplied it. What he has put in your hands is meant to be used, not hidden.", "sky": "dawn", "ground": "field",
     "cast": [{"k": "plant", "x": 300, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "grow", "at": 0.4}]}, {"k": "plant", "x": 540, "s": 1.9, "acts": [{"do": "grow", "at": 0.9}]}, {"k": "plant", "x": 780, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "grow", "at": 1.4}]}]}]},
  {"id": "ten-virgins", "style": "parchment", "genre": "parable", "title": "The Ten Virgins", "ref": "Matthew 25:13",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "Ten bridesmaids waited through the night for the bridegroom, each with a lamp. Five brought extra oil. Five did not.", "sky": "night", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "lamp", "x": 160, "y": 1450, "s": 1.0, "acts": [{"do": "flicker"}]}, {"k": "lamp", "x": 330, "y": 1460, "s": 1.0, "acts": [{"do": "flicker"}]}, {"k": "lamp", "x": 500, "y": 1460, "s": 1.0, "acts": [{"do": "flicker"}]},
              {"k": "lamp", "x": 670, "y": 1460, "s": 1.0, "acts": [{"do": "flicker"}]}, {"k": "lamp", "x": 840, "y": 1450, "s": 1.0, "acts": [{"do": "flicker"}]},
              {"k": "crowd", "x": 540, "y": 1370, "s": 0.85, "n": 10}]},
    {"say": "The bridegroom was late. They all slumbered and slept.", "sky": "night", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "crowd", "x": 540, "y": 1370, "s": 0.85, "n": 10, "acts": [{"do": "kneel", "at": 0.6}]}]},
    {"say": "At midnight there was a cry: Behold, the bridegroom cometh. The lamps of the five went out.", "sky": "night", "ground": "city", "fx": ["rays"],
     "cast": [{"k": "lamp", "x": 300, "y": 1460, "s": 1.0, "acts": [{"do": "flicker"}, {"do": "vanish", "at": 2.4}]}, {"k": "lamp", "x": 780, "y": 1460, "s": 1.0, "acts": [{"do": "flicker"}]},
              {"k": "crowd", "x": 540, "y": 1370, "s": 0.85, "n": 10}]},
    {"say": "While they went to buy oil, the door was shut. Watch therefore, for ye know neither the day nor the hour.", "sky": "dawn", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "house", "x": 540, "s": 1.2}, {"k": "woman", "x": 900, "s": 1.5, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "walk", "to": 760, "at": 0.4, "dur": 2.4}, {"do": "reach", "at": 3.0}]}]}]},
  {"id": "pharisee-and-publican", "style": "parchment", "genre": "parable", "title": "Two Men Went Up to Pray", "ref": "Luke 18:13",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "Two men went up to the temple to pray. One was a Pharisee, admired by everyone. The other, a tax collector, despised by everyone.", "sky": "day", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "elder", "x": 360, "s": 1.6}, {"k": "man", "x": 820, "s": 1.5, "flip": true}]},
    {"say": "The Pharisee stood and prayed: God, I thank thee, that I am not as other men are.", "sky": "day", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "elder", "x": 440, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "raise", "at": 0.6}]}]},
    {"say": "The publican, standing afar off, would not lift up so much as his eyes, but smote upon his breast, saying, God be merciful to me a sinner.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "man", "x": 700, "s": 1.5, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "kneel", "at": 0.6}]}]},
    {"say": "Jesus said this man went home justified. God is not impressed by our resumes. He is moved by honest hearts.", "sky": "dawn", "ground": "city", "fx": ["rays"],
     "cast": [{"k": "man", "x": 600, "s": 1.5, "flip": true, "acts": [{"do": "kneel"}, {"do": "stand", "at": 1.6}]}, {"k": "jesus", "x": 300, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "bless", "at": 0.8}]}]}]},
  {"id": "the-lost-coin", "style": "parchment", "genre": "parable", "title": "The Lost Coin", "ref": "Luke 15:10",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "A woman had ten silver coins, likely her savings, maybe her dowry. One was gone.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "house", "x": 760, "s": 1.0}, {"k": "woman", "x": 380, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "reach", "at": 1.6}]}]},
    {"say": "She lit a candle, swept the house, and searched diligently till she found it.", "sky": "night", "ground": "city",
     "cast": [{"k": "lamp", "x": 300, "y": 1360, "s": 1.2, "acts": [{"do": "flicker"}]}, {"k": "woman", "x": 520, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "kneel", "at": 0.6}, {"do": "walk", "to": 720, "at": 1.4, "dur": 3}]},
              {"k": "coin", "x": 860, "y": 1400, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "appear", "at": 3.8}]}]},
    {"say": "Then she called her friends and neighbours: Rejoice with me; for I have found the piece which I had lost.", "sky": "day", "ground": "city", "fx": ["sparkle"],
     "cast": [{"k": "woman", "x": 540, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "raise", "at": 0.6}]}, {"k": "crowd", "x": 540, "y": 1370, "s": 0.7, "n": 8}]},
    {"say": "Likewise, there is joy in the presence of the angels of God over one sinner that repenteth. You are worth searching for.", "sky": "dawn", "ground": "city", "fx": ["rays"],
     "cast": [{"k": "coin", "x": 540, "y": 1300, "s": 3.0}]}]},
  {"id": "the-rich-fool", "style": "parchment", "genre": "parable", "title": "The Rich Fool", "ref": "Luke 12:20",
   "beats": [
    {"say": "A rich man's land produced so much that he had nowhere to store it all.", "sky": "day", "ground": "field",
     "cast": [{"k": "house", "x": 720, "s": 1.1}, {"k": "man", "x": 360, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "raise", "at": 1.6}]}]},
    {"say": "He said: I will pull down my barns, and build greater. Soul, take thine ease, eat, drink, and be merry.", "sky": "dusk", "ground": "field",
     "cast": [{"k": "house", "x": 720, "s": 1.1, "acts": [{"do": "collapse", "at": 1.2}]}, {"k": "house", "x": 720, "s": 1.5, "acts": [{"do": "grow", "at": 3.0, "grow": 2}]},
              {"k": "man", "x": 330, "s": 1.55}]},
    {"say": "But God said unto him: Thou fool, this night thy soul shall be required of thee.", "sky": "night", "ground": "field",
     "cast": [{"k": "house", "x": 720, "s": 1.5}, {"k": "man", "x": 330, "s": 1.55, "acts": [{"do": "kneel", "at": 1.8}]}]},
    {"say": "A man's life consisteth not in the abundance of the things which he possesseth. Be rich toward God.", "sky": "dawn", "ground": "field",
