              {"k": "jesus", "x": 560, "s": 1.6, "acts": [{"do": "walk", "to": 640, "at": 0.4, "dur": 3}]}]},
    {"say": "Being in an agony he prayed more earnestly. His sorrow was so deep that his sweat fell like drops of blood.", "sky": "night", "ground": "garden",
